### ==============================================================================
### Multi-Tenant AI Inference Platform - REST API Scratchpad
### Extension: humao.rest-client (VS Code)
###
### INSTRUCTIONS:
### Each section below is an end-to-end USE CASE CYCLE.
### You can run each request in a cycle top-to-bottom sequentially.
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@tenantId = tenant-default
@apiKey = dev-secret-key

### ==============================================================================
### USE CASE 1: Platform Health & Dependency Verification
### Verify that Fastify API, PostgreSQL, MinIO (S3), and ElasticMQ (SQS) are ready
### ==============================================================================

# 1.1 Liveness Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

###

# 1.2 Readiness Probe (verifies PostgreSQL, MinIO, and ElasticMQ connectivity)
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz


### ==============================================================================
### USE CASE 2: Full Workload Lifecycle (Happy Path)
### Submit -> Queue -> Processing -> Inference Success -> Fetch Artifacts
### ==============================================================================

# 2.1 Submit Asynchronous Job
# @name submitHappyJob
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "model_id": "meta-llama/Llama-3-8B-Instruct",
  "routing_preference": "auto",
  "priority": 5,
  "input": {
    "prompt": "Explain Raft consensus protocol in distributed databases.",
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.7,
      "max_new_tokens": 256
    }
  }
}

### Auto-captured Job ID from 2.1
@happyJobId = {{submitHappyJob.response.body.job_id}}

###

# 2.2 Inspect Queued Job State
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs/{{happyJobId}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

# 2.3 Worker Leases Job & Begins Execution (Transitions to PROCESSING)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs/{{happyJobId}}/transition
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "status": "PROCESSING",
  "provider": "local_pytorch"
}

###

# 2.4 Worker Finishes Inference & Persists Results (Transitions to SUCCEEDED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs/{{happyJobId}}/transition
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "status": "SUCCEEDED",
  "provider": "local_pytorch",
  "output": {
    "output_text": "Raft is a consensus algorithm designed as an alternative to Multi-Paxos, optimizing for understandability through leader election, log replication, and safety guarantees.",
    "finish_reason": "stop"
  },
  "output_uri": "s3://platform-artifacts/tenants/{{tenantId}}/outputs/{{happyJobId}}/result.json",
  "duration_ms": 1340,
  "tokens_in": 14,
  "tokens_out": 42,
  "cost_microcents": 210
}

###

# 2.5 Query Completed Job (Returns output, token usage, and presigned S3 download URL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs/{{happyJobId}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


