### ==============================================================================
### USE CASE 6: Asynchronous Worker Execution, Retries & Dead-Letter Queue (DLQ)
### Demonstrates worker job processing, Russian Doll profiling, transient retry, and DLQ
### ==============================================================================

# 6.1 Submit Job with Transient First-Attempt Failure
# @name submitTransientJob
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
x-correlation-id: corr-worker-transient-001

{
  "model_id": "meta-llama/Llama-3-8B-Instruct",
  "max_retries": 3,
  "input": {
    "prompt": "Test bounded retry backoff on transient worker failure.",
    "_simulate_failure": "transient_once"
  }
}

### Auto-captured Job ID from 6.1
@transientJobId = {{submitTransientJob.response.body.job_id}}

###

# 6.2 Trigger Worker Tick (Attempt 1 fails transiently -> status becomes RETRYING, retry_count = 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/worker/process-next
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

# 6.3 Inspect Retrying Job State (Verify status = RETRYING, retry_count = 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs/{{transientJobId}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

# 6.4 Submit Job with Permanent Failure (Poison Pill -> Routed to DLQ)
# @name submitPoisonJob
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
x-correlation-id: corr-worker-dlq-002

{
  "model_id": "meta-llama/Llama-3-8B-Instruct",
  "max_retries": 2,
  "input": {
    "prompt": "Trigger permanent model error and quarantine in DLQ.",
    "_simulate_failure": "permanent"
  }
}

### Auto-captured Job ID from 6.4
@poisonJobId = {{submitPoisonJob.response.body.job_id}}

###

# 6.5 Trigger Worker Tick to Process Poison Pill (Transitions to FAILED and sends to DLQ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/worker/process-next
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

# 6.6 Inspect Dead-Letter Queue (DLQ) Messages for Tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs/dlq
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


